{"seq":22,"slug":"ai-search-retrieval","title":"AI 搜索与信息检索","stage":"DONE","category":"ai-llm","chapterCount":5,"docCount":15,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/ai-search-retrieval","rating":{"composite":4.12,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":4.2,"coverage":3.5,"positioning":4.5,"strategic":4.33},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":{"composite":3.48,"verdict":"neutral","uScore":3.5}},"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"ai-搜索与信息检索-简介\">AI 搜索与信息检索 简介</h1><p>AI 搜索与信息检索是人工智能在搜索引擎和信息系统中的核心应用领域。随着大语言模型和神经网络技术的飞速发展，传统基于关键词匹配的检索方式正在被语义理解驱动的智能搜索所取代。本 hub 回答一个完整的问题：<strong>当用户输入一句查询，系统如何在几十毫秒内从十亿级语料中找出最相关的十几条结果</strong>——从底层的向量表示与索引结构，到查询侧的意图理解与改写，再到排序漏斗与效果评估，最后落到可支撑万级 QPS 的系统架构。</p>\n<p>本 hub 面向有一定机器学习基础的中高级工程师，尤其适合从事搜索引擎研发、推荐系统开发、自然语言处理等方向的技术人员。</p>\n<h2 id=\"与相邻-hub-的分工边界\">与相邻 hub 的分工边界</h2><p>&quot;检索&quot;这个词在多个 hub 里都会出现，先说清各自管什么，避免你在错的地方找答案：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Hub</th>\n<th>它负责什么</th>\n<th>本 hub 与它的关系</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><a href=\"../rag-knowledge-systems/\">RAG 与知识系统</a></td>\n<td>检索增强生成的端到端工程链路：分块、检索、生成的编排</td>\n<td>本 hub 只讲其中&quot;检索&quot;这一环的通用原理与方法论，不涉及生成侧与提示词编排</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"../text-embeddings-representation/\">文本嵌入与表示学习</a></td>\n<td>嵌入模型本身：怎么训练、怎么压缩、怎么评测选型</td>\n<td>本 hub 的嵌入模型一章是管线视角的概览；要深挖嵌入训练与选型请去 67</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"../reranking-retrieval-models/\">重排序与检索模型</a></td>\n<td>重排器这一阶段的模型族纵深：Cross-Encoder、ColBERT、LLM 重排</td>\n<td>本 hub 讲重排在完整搜索系统中的位置与级联架构；单模型细节以 69 为准</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"../retrieval-chunking-strategies/\">检索分块策略</a></td>\n<td>文档进检索系统之前怎么切块、带什么上下文</td>\n<td>分块发生在本 hub 覆盖范围的上游，本 hub 默认拿到的是已切好的检索单元</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"../natural-language-processing/\">自然语言处理</a></td>\n<td>NLP 基础任务：分词、命名实体识别、文本分类</td>\n<td>这些任务是查询理解一章的积木；本 hub 只讲它们在搜索场景下的特定用法</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"../ai-recommendation-systems/\">AI 推荐系统</a></td>\n<td>以用户兴趣为中心的个性化召回与排序</td>\n<td>推荐与本 hub 共享排序技术栈（LTR、多阶段漏斗），但优化目标是相关性而非个性化</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>一句话概括：<strong>别人分别讲嵌入、重排器、分块或整条 RAG 流水线；本 hub 讲的是把这一切串起来的那条完整搜索链路本身。</strong></p>\n<h2 id=\"推荐学习路径\">推荐学习路径</h2><p>全书五章是一条从算法到系统的主线：第一章<strong>神经信息检索</strong>建立现代检索的底层认知（稠密检索、混合检索、嵌入模型）；第二章<strong>查询理解</strong>聚焦用户查询侧（解析、改写、语义匹配）；第三章<strong>排序模型</strong>深入排序质量优化的核心（学习排序、交叉编码器重排序、多阶段排序）；第四章<strong>搜索评估</strong>提供度量方法论（离线指标、在线实验、人工评估）；第五章<strong>搜索基础设施</strong>收口于工程落地（向量数据库、索引服务化、系统架构）。</p>\n<p>不同背景的读者建议按以下顺序切入：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>读者画像</th>\n<th>建议路径</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><strong>零搜索经验的 ML 工程师</strong></td>\n<td>从头按章顺读：1 → 2 → 3 → 4 → 5。第一章的双塔与 ANN 是全书的共同语言，跳过会在后面反复卡壳</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>有传统搜索（ES/Lucene）经验</strong></td>\n<td>先读第一章补齐神经检索范式（<a href=\"neural-retrieval/dense-retrieval\">稠密检索</a>、<a href=\"neural-retrieval/sparse-dense-hybrid\">稀疏与稠密混合检索</a>），再直接进入第三章和第五章——你已有的倒排索引入识能让你快速对照新旧架构</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>RAG 应用开发者</strong></td>\n<td>重点读第一章（选嵌入、建混合检索）与第四章（怎么验证检索质量真的变好了），第五章的<a href=\"search-infrastructure/vector-databases\">向量数据库</a>用于选型；生成侧与分块策略不在本 hub 范围内</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>搜索算法研究员</strong></td>\n<td>第二章与第三章是主战场（查询理解 + 排序模型），第四章的统计显著性检验与偏差校正是做实验前必须掌握的方法论</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"前置知识\">前置知识</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>线性代数</strong>：向量、点积、余弦相似度——第一章大量使用，不熟悉会寸步难行</li>\n<li><strong>深度学习基础</strong>：Transformer 与 BERT 的结构、微调的基本概念；不需要训练经验，但要能读懂&quot;编码器&quot;&quot;注意力&quot;这类术语</li>\n<li><strong>基本机器学习</strong>：分类/回归、损失函数、梯度下降——第三章的学习排序以此为基础</li>\n<li><strong>经典信息检索概念</strong>（有帮助但非必需）：了解倒排索引与 TF-IDF 即可，BM25 会在使用处给出必要说明</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>分块策略如何影响下游召回：<a href=\"../retrieval-chunking-strategies/\">检索分块策略</a></li>\n<li>把本 hub 的检索环节装进完整生成系统：<a href=\"../rag-knowledge-systems/\">RAG 与知识系统</a></li>\n</ul>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"neural-retrieval","title":"神经信息检索","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/ai-search-retrieval/neural-retrieval","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"dense-retrieval","title":"稠密检索","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/ai-search-retrieval/neural-retrieval/dense-retrieval"},{"seq":2,"slug":"sparse-dense-hybrid","title":"稀疏与稠密混合检索","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/ai-search-retrieval/neural-retrieval/sparse-dense-hybrid"},{"seq":3,"slug":"embedding-models","title":"嵌入模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/ai-search-retrieval/neural-retrieval/embedding-models"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"query-understanding","title":"查询理解","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/ai-search-retrieval/query-understanding","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"query-parsing","title":"查询解析","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/ai-search-retrieval/query-understanding/query-parsing"},{"seq":2,"slug":"query-rewriting","title":"查询改写","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/ai-search-retrieval/query-understanding/query-rewriting"},{"seq":3,"slug":"semantic-matching","title":"语义匹配","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/ai-search-retrieval/query-understanding/semantic-matching"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"ranking-models","title":"排序模型","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/ai-search-retrieval/ranking-models","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"learning-to-rank","title":"学习排序","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/ai-search-retrieval/ranking-models/learning-to-rank"},{"seq":2,"slug":"cross-encoder-reranking","title":"交叉编码器重排序","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/ai-search-retrieval/ranking-models/cross-encoder-reranking"},{"seq":3,"slug":"multi-stage-ranking","title":"多阶段排序","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/ai-search-retrieval/ranking-models/multi-stage-ranking"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"search-evaluation","title":"搜索评估","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/ai-search-retrieval/search-evaluation","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"offline-metrics","title":"离线评估指标","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/ai-search-retrieval/search-evaluation/offline-metrics"},{"seq":2,"slug":"online-evaluation","title":"在线评估","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/ai-search-retrieval/search-evaluation/online-evaluation"},{"seq":3,"slug":"human-evaluation","title":"人工评估","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/ai-search-retrieval/search-evaluation/human-evaluation"}]},{"seq":5,"slug":"search-infrastructure","title":"搜索基础设施","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/ai-search-retrieval/search-infrastructure","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"vector-databases","title":"向量数据库","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/ai-search-retrieval/search-infrastructure/vector-databases"},{"seq":2,"slug":"indexing-serving","title":"索引构建与在线服务","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/ai-search-retrieval/search-infrastructure/indexing-serving"},{"seq":3,"slug":"search-system-architecture","title":"搜索系统架构","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/ai-search-retrieval/search-infrastructure/search-system-architecture"}]}]}